  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-normal leading-[normal] left-[64px] not-italic text-[#5a5a5a] text-[16px] top-[122px] whitespace-nowrap">
    KPI cockpit Q1 to Q3 2026, actuals vs. plan
  </p>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-semibold leading-[normal] left-[560px] not-italic text-[#8a877f] text-[20px] top-[170px] whitespace-nowrap">
    Plan Q3
  </p>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-semibold leading-[normal] left-[660px] not-italic text-[#141414] text-[20px] top-[170px] whitespace-nowrap">
    Δ vs. plan
  </p>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-semibold leading-[normal] left-[800px] not-italic text-[#141414] text-[20px] top-[170px] whitespace-nowrap">
    Trend
  </p>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-normal leading-[normal] left-[560px] not-italic text-[#8a877f] text-[20px] top-[234px] whitespace-nowrap">
