  </p>
  <div class="absolute h-[20px] left-[800px] top-[300px] w-[60px]">
    <img alt="" class="absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full" src={asset('slides/table/sparkline1.svg')} />
  </div>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-normal leading-[normal] left-[560px] not-italic text-[#8a877f] text-[20px] top-[362px] whitespace-nowrap">
    1.5 %
  </p>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-semibold leading-[normal] left-[660px] not-italic text-[#1f8a4c] text-[20px] top-[362px] whitespace-nowrap">
    ▲ 0.1 pp
  </p>
  <div class="absolute h-[20px] left-[800px] top-[364px] w-[60px]">
    <img alt="" class="absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full" src={asset('slides/table/sparkline2.svg')} />
  </div>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-normal leading-[normal] left-[560px] not-italic text-[#8a877f] text-[20px] top-[426px] whitespace-nowrap">
    55
  </p>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-semibold leading-[normal] left-[660px] not-italic text-[#c8372d] text-[20px] top-[426px] whitespace-nowrap">
    ▼ 3 pts
  </p>
  <div class="absolute h-[20px] left-[800px] top-[428px] w-[60px]">
    <img alt="" class="absolute block inset-0 max-w-none size-full" src={asset('slides/table/sparkline3.svg')} />
  </div>
  <p class="[word-break:break-word] absolute font-normal leading-[normal] left-[64px] not-italic text-[#8a877f] text-[11px] top-[476px] whitespace-pre">▲ ahead of plan   ▼ behind plan   Churn = monthly logo churn, lower is better.   Source: CRM, Finance controlling</p>
  <p class="-translate-x-full [word-break:break-word] absolute font-normal leading-[normal] left-[896px] not-italic text-[#8a877f] text-[11px] text-right top-[476px] w-[200px] whitespace-pre-wrap">Northwind & Co.  |  8</p>
  <div class="absolute border border-[rgba(20,20,20,0.25)] border-solid h-[26px] left-[800px] rounded-[13px] top-[74px] w-[96px]"></div>
  <p class="-translate-x-1/2 [word-break:break-word] absolute font-semibold leading-[normal] left-[848px] not-italic text-[#1f8a4c] text-[12px] text-center top-[79px] w-[96px]">
    On track
  </p>
</div>
